category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Free software library to send/receive data according to the Modbus protocol (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "libmodbus is a C library designed to provide a fast and robust implementation
of the Modbus protocol. It runs on Linux, Mac OS X, FreeBSD, QNX and Windows."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/stephane/libmodbus/
license: LGPL-2.1-or-later
